{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29135","headline":"留别赵端公 · 许浑","name":"留别赵端公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海门征櫂赴龙泷，暂寄华筵倒玉缸。\n箫鼓散时逢夜雨，绮罗分处下秋江。\n孤帆已过滕王阁，高榻留眠谢守窗。\n却愿烟波阻风雪，待君同拜碧油幢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}